warning[field_reassign_with_default]: `config` is made with its defaults and then its fields set
  --> tests/lint/field_reassign_with_default/bad.jai:11:5
   |
11 |     config: Config;
   |     ^^^^^^
   |
help: set the fields in a struct literal where the variable is declared
   |
10   make :: (title: string) -> Config {
11 ~     config := Config.{ width = 100, title = title };
12 -     config.width = 100;
13 -     config.title = title;
14
   |
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/field_reassign_with_default

